{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>方力申今晨（21日）8時53分由香港大嶼山雞翼角下水，展開長達35公里的港澳公海海域橫渡挑戰，為「凝動香港體育基金」及「澳門特殊奧運會」籌款，目標為港幣1,000萬元。截至下午3時半，方力申已游至第25公里，距離終點只餘10公里；而截至下午3時17分，他已為活動籌得7,516,703港元。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.100520+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:47:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T03:56:24.278883+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:26.645461+00:00","content_hash":"54515d8cbea3fb1715add8559aed0d1ee6a8a3d71487cfe55799cbc11b14685b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}